{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも沢山の声援"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もブログを更新しましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は大切な、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに伝えたいことがあったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書かせてもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日放送されました乃木坂ってどこ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で発表になりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はセカンドシングルでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな歌を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌わせていただける事になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までに暫定選抜、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第一回選抜、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファーストシングル選抜が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のファースト選抜は重みのある"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっしりとしたものでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年から渡された七福神という使命。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルが楽しい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルが大好き、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌、ダンス、お仕事、イベント、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しい、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう毎日アイドルという職業を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでいた私でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この使命だけは大きなハードルでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は毎日毎日怖かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神を目指して日々頑張っている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが沢山いるのだから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失敗は許されない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレッシャーとの戦いでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の表現に違和感を感じ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後悔した日も何度もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きだったトークに自信をなくし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期の自分にあった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっすぐな目を取り戻すため、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭を悩ませていた頃、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迎えたこのセカンドシングル選抜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の時とは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれた時の心境が違いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を見返して気づいたこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"今のままではいけない\"と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今、もうセカンドシングルに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"向けて動いていますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつ、自分が見えてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が見えなくなったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右も左もわからない状態で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この世界にいきなり足を踏み入れ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無力ながらも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待に目を輝かせていた自分に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戻ってみようと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの経験を生かしつつ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初心を忘れないように頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待に添えられるよう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生をかけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46を愛して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長させていきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私がずっと心がけている、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも忘れてはいけないもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"真心\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだけは常に持ち続けていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが無駄であることは絶対にない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思うから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後になりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくださる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆様へ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様のおかげで、私は人としても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルとしても一まわりも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二まわりも大きくなれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を応援してよかったって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何十年も先に思い返してもらえたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵だなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人でも多くの方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思ってもらえるように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも乃木坂46及び"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山一実を応援してください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/8336048/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}